1
00:00:00,290 --> 00:00:02,820
Nobody is coming to save you.

2
00:00:04,750 --> 00:00:06,440
Not your boss.

3
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,660
Not your family.

4
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:11,080
Not motivation.

5
00:00:12,650 --> 00:00:14,940
Motivation is a feeling.

6
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:18,260
Feelings fade by Tuesday.

7
00:00:21,790 --> 00:00:24,400
But get 1% better every day,

8
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:25,530
and in a year,

9
00:00:25,550 --> 00:00:27,910
you're 37 times better.

10
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:31,560
1% worse…

11
00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:33,630
and you're almost zero.

12
00:00:38,150 --> 00:00:40,490
Discipline isn't punishment.

13
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:43,510
It's a promise you keep to yourself,

14
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:45,200
quietly,

15
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:47,680
when no one is watching.

16
00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:51,610
So stop waiting.

17
00:00:52,170 --> 00:00:53,820
Start the system.

18
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:56,830
Day one is today.

19
00:01:00,520 --> 00:01:02,320
Nobody is coming.

20
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:03,570
Good.

21
00:01:04,010 --> 00:01:06,010
Now you know who has to.
